── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────────────────────── E0100_python_elif.lt:2:18  [E0100]

Stilt writes `else if`, not `elif`:

  2 │   if n > 0 { 1 } elif n < 0 { -1 } else { 0 }
    │                  ^^^^

An `if` chains to another with `else if`.

To fix it, write `else if`:

  2 │   if n > 0 { 1 } else if n < 0 { -1 } else { 0 }
    │                  ~~~~~~~
